    "The thirty did not want to be cruel — they wanted to avoid paying a bet. How does something that starts small end up doing so much damage?",
    "Samson kept the secret from his parents but gave it to his wife on day seven. Why do you think he finally told her?",
    "One frightened person, one secret. Where else have you seen a small thing turn into something huge?"
